<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21913" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γενν-ητικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>generative, productive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ πρᾶξις ἡ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					539b21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψυχὴ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>de An.</u>
					416b25
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., <i>generative</i> or <i>productive of</i> . . , 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					1p.11U.
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>GA</u>
				726b21
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕλην σπέρματος -κήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epicur.
					<u>Nat.Herc.</u>
					908.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of men or
			animals, <i>able to procreate</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				544b26
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>de An.</u>
				432b24
			</span></i>.</div>
